# Tasks: Integration Effort Estimator

**Input**: Design documents from `/specs/001-effort-estimator/`
**Prerequisites**: plan.md (required), spec.md (required for user stories)

**Tests**: Tests are MANDATORY for the Integration Effort Estimator per Constitution Principle VI (Test-First Development). All calculation functions require unit tests; main user flow requires component test(s).

**Organization**: Tasks are grouped by user story to enable independent implementation and testing of each story.

## Format: `[ID] [P?] [Story] Description`

- **[P]**: Can run in parallel (different files, no dependencies)
- **[Story]**: Which user story this task belongs to (e.g., US1, US2, US3)
- Include exact file paths in descriptions

## Path Conventions

- **Frontend-only project**: `src/`, `tests/` at repository root
- Paths shown below use this structure as defined in plan.md

---

## Phase 1: Setup (Shared Infrastructure)

**Purpose**: Project initialization and basic structure

- [ ] T001 Initialize Vite React TypeScript project with `npm create vite@latest . -- --template react-ts`
- [ ] T002 Install dependencies: `npm install react@^18.2.0 react-dom@^18.2.0`
- [ ] T003 [P] Install dev dependencies: `npm install -D @testing-library/react@^14.0.0 @testing-library/user-event@^14.5.0 @types/react@^18.2.0 @types/react-dom@^18.2.0 @vitejs/plugin-react@^4.2.0 typescript@^5.3.0 vite@^5.0.0 vitest@^1.0.0 @vitest/ui jsdom @testing-library/jest-dom`
- [ ] T004 [P] Configure tsconfig.json with strict mode enabled and target ES2020
- [ ] T005 [P] Configure vite.config.ts with Vitest plugin and test environment setup
- [ ] T006 Create directory structure: `mkdir -p src/{components,lib} tests/{unit,components} public`
- [ ] T007 [P] Add test scripts to package.json: `"test": "vitest"`, `"test:ui": "vitest --ui"`, `"test:coverage": "vitest --coverage"`
- [ ] T008 [P] Create .gitignore with node_modules, dist, coverage, .env entries

**Checkpoint**: Project scaffolding complete - ready for implementation

