## Phase 3: User Story 1 - Calculate Single Feature Effort (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP

**Goal**: Users can enter project name + one feature with costs and see calculated MD with role distribution

**Independent Test**: Enter project name, add one feature (Use Case/API, 10000 THB project cost), verify Estimated MD = 2 and output table shows SA=0, QA=0, BE=0, Support=1, Rest=1, Support+Rest=2

### Tests for User Story 1 (MANDATORY per Constitution) ✅

> **NOTE: Write these tests FIRST, ensure they FAIL before implementation**

- [ ] T018 [P] [US1] Create tests/unit/calculations.test.ts with describe block for calculateEstimatedMD
- [ ] T019 [P] [US1] Write unit test: calculateEstimatedMD(10000, 0) should return 2
- [ ] T020 [P] [US1] Write unit test: calculateEstimatedMD(12500, 0) should return 2 (floor rounds down)
- [ ] T021 [P] [US1] Write unit test: calculateEstimatedMD(0, 0) should return 0
- [ ] T022 [P] [US1] Write unit test: calculateEstimatedMD(50000000, 0) should return 10000 (large numbers)
- [ ] T023 [P] [US1] Write unit test: calculateEstimatedMD(12345.67, 0) should return 2 (fractional costs)
- [ ] T024 [P] [US1] Add describe block for calculateRoleAllocations in tests/unit/calculations.test.ts
- [ ] T025 [P] [US1] Write unit test: calculateRoleAllocations('Use Case / API', 2) returns {sa:0, qa:0, be:0, support:1, restMD:1, supportPlusRest:2}
